| **Merger & Acquisition** | M&A activity — potential tool consolidation opportunity |
| **Cost Cutting** | Company is reducing costs — opportunity to offer efficiency tools |
| **Workforce Growth** | Headcount increase across departments |
| **Workforce Reduction** | Layoffs — be sensitive; can signal budget pressure |
| **Company Award** | Recognition signal — good opening for a congratulatory outreach |
| **New Product** | Product launch — opportunity for integration pitch |
| **New Partnership** | New business partnership — potential new ICP or expansion |
