# Common Troubleshooting Guide

| Issue | Likely Cause | Solution |
|---|---|---|
| "Insufficient credits" | Credit balance at 0 | Upgrade plan or purchase credits in Settings |
| "Explorium credit error" | Explorium API key quota exhausted | Contact Outmate admin |
| No leads returned | Filters too narrow | Broaden filter criteria, try removing one filter |
| AI Agent taking 60+ seconds | Normal for deep research | Wait — the agent is running web searches |
| Gmail send fails | Gmail not connected | Connect Gmail via Integrations or Campaigns → Email Accounts |
| LinkedIn send fails | Unipile not configured | Contact admin to configure Unipile API key |
| NLP search returns wrong type | Intent detection ambiguity | Explicitly add "companies" or "people" to your query |
| Visitor IP not resolved | Residential/consumer IP | Coverage is best for corporate IP ranges |
| Signal no results | Company not in Explorium database | Try using domain instead of company name |
| Research report empty | Unknown company | Add company domain or use an alternative company name spelling |
